# ================================================================
# Large data files exceeding GitHub 100MB limit
# These are raw satellite data / shapefiles that are too large for
# GitHub. They can be downloaded from their original sources:
#   - GADM: https://gadm.org/download_world.html
#   - GEOGLAM: https://cropmonitor.org/tools/calendars/
#   - Copernicus SWI: https://land.copernicus.eu/global/products/swi
# ================================================================

